        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4701, Traditional Beaded Middle Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beading on this refrigerator pull not only adds classic beauty to this piece, but it also provides an ergonomic grip. This 12 inch c.c. handle can be used on almost any appliance. It is available in 6 beautiful finishes including timeless oil rubbed bronze and the ever popular satin nickel (pictured right). Made by RK International, the Traditional Beaded  Middle Appliance Pull is sure to add traditional glamor to any kitchen.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3701\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4701 Decorative Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
